ont-family: 함초롬바탕\">이내</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 66.92pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 124.82pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">공 동 연 구 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">과 제 수 행 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">첨단장비운용</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 231.06pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 124.82pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- IT </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">의료공학 융합분야 연구개발에 관심이 있는 학생</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학부 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3,4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년생으로 금오공대 대학원 진학 예정자</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(15</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 졸업예정자 우대</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">분 야 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전자공학</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기계공학</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, IT</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">메디컬융합공학</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">근무지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신평동 소재 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">IT</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">의료융합기술센터</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">보 수 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 80</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">만원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">+</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(part time)</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕